@startuml avs-lifecycle
title AVS Lifecycle (CR-VAS-007)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam roundCorner 10
skinparam shadowing false

state "Proposed" as P
state "Assessed" as A
state "Designed" as D
state "Qualified" as Q
state "Approved" as AP
state "Implemented" as IM
state "Operational" as O
state "Managed" as MG
state "Suspended" as S
state "Retired" as R

P -> A : assessment
A -> D : design
D -> Q : qualification
Q -> AP : approval
AP -> IM : implementation
IM -> O : activation
O -> MG : management

O -> S : trigger / breach
S -> O : revalidation / recovery
O -> R : retirement
S -> R : retirement
MG -> S : governance action

note right of O
  Operational state does NOT imply
  continuing conformance (AVS-GOV-INV-003).
end note

note right of Q
  Qualification is a semantic state.
  Approval is a governance decision.
  They are distinct (AVS-GOV-INV-002).
end note

@enduml
